- [N10] Node-level mutation: element=label(n3,c1,"No  continue"); source=i1:At the beginning, if we can capture data from FMA, we should continue the process.; reason=Both carry the payload "No continue", which directly contradicts the explicit source instruction to "continue the process" after either data capture attempt.
